  "description": "At his adoptive father’s urging, Tae-min reluctantly agrees to go on a blind date. But the person who shows up is none other than his beloved younger brother, Ji-ho.\n\n*“Are you Mr. Lee Tae-min?”  \n“What are you doing here?”  \n“I’m here for the blind date. I like you, hyung.”  \n“…I’ve never liked you that way.”*\n\nTae-min rejects Ji-ho’s confession, but something in his chest feels uneasy. The next day, he wakes up completely naked—locked up in an unfamiliar room by someone.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/turn_away), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/uncomfortable_disregard)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[T.Chinese](https://www.bomtoon.tw/detail/turn_away), [Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/line_between)",
